<p>From this, we also notice the next string in the sequence after =E2=80=
=9Cabc=E2=80=9D is =E2=80=9Cacb=E2=80=9D, which is the first string larger =
than the original string:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a table illustrating a mapping between char=
acter sequences and numerical sequences.  Six rows display different permut=
