</ul>
<ol start=3D"2">
<li>
<p>Find the rightmost successor to the pivot.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Swap the rightmost successor with the pivot to increase the lexicographi=
cal order of the suffix.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Reverse the suffix after the pivot to minimize its permutation.</p>
</li>
</ol>
